# Local audit-trail logs written by Claude Code skills (see root CLAUDE.md's
# "every skill logs its runs" convention) — not part of the shipped repo.
logs/

# pr-reviewer's output. Unlike changelog/, this can't cleanly ride along
# with the push it reviews (the review runs *after* push, in the
# background, and can take minutes) — so it stays local; pr-merge only
# ever needs to read it from the working tree, never from GitHub.
reviews/

